        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***Superb Town-Centre Location***\r\n\r\n4 Saint Michael’s Court, Athy, Co. Kildare, R14 PA43 is an excellent choice for first-time buyers, growing families, or investors. This three-bedroom semi-detached family home combines a highly desirable, peaceful cul-de-sac positioning with the ultimate convenience of town-centre living.\r\nTucked away at the end of a quiet, private cul-de-sac, Tony Donnelly and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present this spacious property to the market. Boasting a private, un-overlooked rear garden complete with a block-built shed, this home is ready for its next chapter.\r\n                    \r\nLocation is everything and 4 Saint Michael’s Court delivers effortlessly. Situated in the heart of Athy, the property ensures everything you need is just a short stroll away:\r\n•\tCommuter-Friendly: Within easy walking distance to Athy Train Station, providing direct and easy access for commuters.\r\n•\tFamily & Education: Just minutes from excellent local primary and secondary schools.\r\n•\tLeisure & Amenities: Conveniently close to the local swimming pool, essential shops, and vibrant local sports amenities including the Athy Rugby and GAA clubs.\r\n\r\nBright & Spacious Accommodation\r\n\r\nThe property features a well-designed, functional layout optimized for modern family living:\r\nGround Floor:\r\n•\tEntrance Hallway: A bright, welcoming, and spacious entry point.\r\n\r\n•\tSitting Room: A cosy yet generous living space featuring a real open fire.\r\n.\r\n•\tKitchen & Dining Area: An open-plan heart of the home, perfect for family meals and entertaining.\r\n\r\n•\tUtility Room: A highly practical separate space for laundry and additional storage.\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n•\tMaster Bedroom: A spacious double room complete with a private en-suite bathroom.\r\n•\tBedrooms 2 & 3: Two additional well-proportioned bedrooms with excellent natural light.\r\n•\tFamily Bathroom: A well-appointed central bathroom serving the upper floor.\r\nKey Services & Features\r\n•\tHeating System: (Oil-Fired Central Heating & Solid Fuel open fire).\r\n•\tUtilities: Connected to mains water and mains sewage.\r\n•\tOutdoor Space: Safe, quiet cul-de-sac location with a private rear garden and a durable block-built storage shed.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the space, privacy, and exceptional location this town-centre gem has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
